00:11:01.619 --> 00:11:03.454
He's officially talked into it.

00:11:04.705 --> 00:11:07.958
Allie is taking
the Chargers, -4.5

00:11:07.958 --> 00:11:09.460
at home against the Ravens.

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:10.961
- He's crazy.
He's absolutely crazy.

00:11:10.961 --> 00:11:12.588
- A lot of people are
gonna say you're crazy.

00:11:12.588 --> 00:11:14.256
