on Baltimore right now.

00:11:16.133 --> 00:11:17.927
- Well, I am.
- Against the Chargers.

00:11:17.927 --> 00:11:20.012
- I am hot and heavy.
I think it's a matchup sport.

00:11:20.012 --> 00:11:21.972
You and I talk about that
all the time, right?

00:11:21.972 --> 00:11:23.307
Every team has their kryptonite.

00:11:23.307 --> 00:11:25.184
I do think that
the Baltimore Ravens

00:11:25.184 --> 00:11:27.061
are kind of the Los Angeles
Chargers' kryptonite.

00:11:27.061 --> 00:11:28.521
The big thing is,
and this is where

00:11:28.521 --> 00:11:30.481
I really worry
