00:11:30.481 --> 00:11:32.108
you've heard me talk about

00:11:32.108 --> 00:11:34.276
they're one of the smallest
defenses in football.

00:11:34.276 --> 00:11:36.654
- Right.
- And their nose tackle

00:11:36.654 --> 00:11:40.032
Damion Square,
is 290-something pounds.

00:11:40.032 --> 00:11:41.659
That's not big in the NFL world

00:11:41.659 --> 00:11:43.494
and especially not against
the Baltimore Ravens

00:11:43.494 --> 00:11:48.541
who are 330, 315, 305, 320
and then 340 on the edge.

00:11:48.541 --> 00:11:50.876
- And they are obsessed
with running the ball.

00:11:50.876 --> 00:11:53.504
- Downhill with a Gus Edwards, who's a big back.
- Yeah.

00:11:53.504 --> 00:11:55.589
- So that's where
they can impose their will.

00:11:55.589 --> 00:11:57.091
They can control the clock.

00:11:57.091 --> 00:11:59.218
And then the Lamar Jackson
element off of it

00:11:59.218 --> 00:12:00.928
to where you start
worrying about

00:12:00.928 --> 00:12:02.722
"Damn, they're smashin' us
in between the tackles"

00:12:02.722 --> 00:12:04.390
and then he keeps it off edge.
- Yeah.

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:07.435
- So they're a very tough team,
I think, matchup-wise.

00:12:07.435 --> 00:12:10.771
- You know that I've ride-or-died with the Eagles my entire life.
- Yes, right.

00:12:10.771 --> 00:12:13.190
