on the bench wearing a ski mask

00:12:16.152 --> 00:12:19.029
or Rodney McLeod leading out
the team with ski masks.

00:12:19.029 --> 00:12:20.698
- Yes.
- Last year, it was

00:12:20.698 --> 00:12:23.409
the underdog masks cuz
they said we were an underdog.

00:12:23.409 --> 00:12:25.035
Now they're the Jack Boys

00:12:25.035 --> 00:12:26.704
which means
we're stealin' stuff.

00:12:26.704 --> 00:12:28.372
- Whoa.
- You think you're gonna win?

00:12:28.372 --> 00:12:29.665
We're robbin' ya.

00:12:29.665 --> 00:12:31.333
And they're all
wearing ski masks.

00:12:31.333 --> 00:12:33.461
- Straight-up Philly style.
- And I have some ski masks.

00:12:33.461 --> 00:12:35.671
- I woulda wore
the dog mask last year.

00:12:35.671 --> 00:12:37.506
- Yeah?
- I'm not wearing this, though.

00:12:37.506 --> 00:12:39.759
- Here's my question for you.
- Yes.

00:12:39.759 --> 00:12:42.011
- There's two games left,
one against the Texans

00:12:42.011 --> 00:12:44.346
then they end the year
with Washington.

00:12:44.346 --> 00:12:46.223
They need other teams to lose.
- Right.

00:12:46.223 --> 00:12:49.310
- Should I emotionally
get into this

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:52.646
or is it best if I just go,
"The Eagles, it was a good run"?

00:12:52.646 --> 00:12:55.149
- No, get into it.
I think it's time. Go ahead.

00:12:55.149 --> 00:12:56.817
I mean, you're playing two teams

00:12:56.817 --> 00:12:58.569
that you match up well with
at the end of the season.

00:12:58.569 --> 00:13:01.614
- I need more. Give me more.
Why? I need more confidence.

00:13:01.614 --> 00:13:03.365
- I don't have
a lot of confidence.

00:13:03.365 --> 00:13:05.743
Like I said, last year,
I woulda put on the dog mask.

00:13:05.743 --> 00:13:07.536
- I do! Nick Foles is baaack!

00:13:07.536 --> 00:13:09.830
- Oh my gosh. Here we go.
- You know what's amazing?

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:14.168
