and I can't see out of this.

00:13:16.504 --> 00:13:18.255
- That's it.
- How do I look, Simms?

00:13:18.255 --> 00:13:20.424
- It's all about the quarterback.
- Jack Boys!

00:13:20.424 --> 00:13:22.885
E-A-G-L-E-S! Eagles! Yes!

00:13:22.885 --> 00:13:25.095
- You look better. It's actually an improvement.
- Thanks, bro.

00:13:25.095 --> 00:13:27.014
- I think you should wear this
every week.

00:13:27.014 --> 00:13:28.641
- For Simms—
- Peace out, homies.

00:13:28.641 --> 00:13:32.520
- I'm the L-E-F-K-O-E.
- Robber...man.

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:35.022
- And we will holla, holla,
holla atcha later.

00:13:35.022 --> 00:13:38.317
Oh my God.
Nick Foles, let's go.

00:13:38.317 --> 00:13:40.110
- [Laughing] You're crazy.

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:43.155
♪♪♪

00:13:43.155 --> 00:13:44.657
Santa, it was nice meeting you.

00:13:44.657 --> 00:13:46.408
